/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 43 0 R
/E (    This report details a strategic security collaboration between Anthropic and Mozilla, where the Claude Opus 4.6 model was utilized to audit the Firefox web browser. Over a focused two-week period, the AI identified 22 new security vulnerabilities, 14 of which were classified as high-severity. These findings represent approximately one-fifth \(20%\) of all high-severity bugs patched in Firefox throughout 2025. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
