<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 43 0 R
/E (    This collaboration underscores the transformative potential of AI-assisted analysis in detecting complex security flaws at a speed and scale that significantly enhances traditional vulnerability research.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
